{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and motion primitives, separating sensing (obstacle events) from action (motion commands). The specification enforces safe, conservative obstacle avoidance, prioritizing random_walk for coverage in clear states, and using short turns for recovery. Full_rotate is reserved for repeated or unrecoverable blockages. All transitions are deterministic, and uncontrollables are always handled first.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for sensing and motion to reflect open-loop action semantics and sensor-driven state changes.",
    "Specification automaton binds perception outcomes to safe, coverage-oriented actions, ensuring only one controllable per state and conservative recovery after obstacles."
